The Devin/Cascade protobuf bindings in this crate are generated with
`prost-build` from the vendored widevin application sources listed in
`proto/SOURCE.lock`.

The source snapshot is widevin commit
`6c48392052caaecca820ec41df9d87ed818dfc21` from:

https://github.com/dante-teo/widevin

That snapshot records its upstream Devin protocol source as the oh-my-pi
provider schema. The vendored `.proto` files retain their source package names
and are included under the widevin MIT license in `LICENSE.widevin`.
